=== ARCH-2: No DML Bypass Gate (Issue #2974 / #3101) ===

✅ 0 NEW bypass path (ARCH-2 compliant)
  Per-file whitelist (allowed; documented in audit #3097 §2.2):
    - vtu_guard.rs, wal_storage.rs, file_storage.rs, engine.rs,
      backup_storage.rs, columnar/storage.rs (test/error strings)
    - trigger.rs, local_executor.rs (INT-4 canonical pattern:
      inside facade.execute_dml / execute_dml_in_tx closure)
    - recovery_engine.rs, backup.rs (WAL replay / backup: design needs)
    - unified-query/src/adapters/storage.rs (cross-engine boundary)
    - parallel_*executor.rs, vector_executor.rs (ISOLATED tests)
    - bench-cli/tpch_data.rs (TPC-H fixture loader)
    - in-file #[test] blocks (auto-filtered via awk)

Production paths:
  All non-test DML routed through ExecutionEngine.execute() or
  VtuGuard::execute_dml()

References:
  - docs/releases/v3.8.0/historical/LEGACY_ISSUES_2026-06-05_AUDIT.md §2.2
  - docs/releases/v3.8.0/INT-4-VTUGUARD-ENFORCEMENT.md
